From 573ffe8dcc255ac1194c87f98445a91be5ca8757 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Chong <achong@meta.com>
Date: Fri, 15 Aug 2025 11:52:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 18/63] modify guest rc file to support changing hwsim 80211 at
 boot config

Summary:
# Motivation:
HWSIM_MAC80211 is set at build time which prevents us from setting up wifi without rebuilding the image.

# Overview:
- change init file in image to allow overriding wifi_impl at boot time

Test Plan:
```
. build/envsetup.sh
lunch aosp_cf_arm64_only_phone-aosp_current-userdebug
m dist
```

Rollback Plan:

Reviewers: tcare, #cuttlefish-cross-platform, benthomas

Reviewed By: tcare

Subscribers: ryanyu, <internal-group>

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D80361488

Tags: aarch64
---
 shared/config/init.vendor.rc | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/shared/config/init.vendor.rc b/shared/config/init.vendor.rc
index 676740244..2f969e8c7 100644
--- a/shared/config/init.vendor.rc
+++ b/shared/config/init.vendor.rc
@@ -54,6 +54,9 @@ on fs
     # So GceBootReporter can print to kmsg
     chmod 622 /dev/kmsg
 
+on early-init && property:ro.boot.vendor.wifi_impl
+    setprop ro.vendor.wifi_impl ${ro.boot.vendor.wifi_impl}
+
 on post-fs-data && property:ro.vendor.disable_rename_eth0=
     # works around framework netiface enumeration issue
     # TODO(b/202731768): Add this `start rename_eth0` command to the init.rc for rename_netiface
